i and utah even if i kind of hope  they don't get together because of rika  that said i am very excited for a maki  and yuta reunion now that she has gone  through the whole setting extermination  thing this clearly isn't the way that  she meant to do things when they talked  in the classroom so i would love to see  yuta's reaction to that it should all be  pretty damn interesting but i would love  to hear what you guys think on the  subject as well as if you're excited for  the movie if you guys enjoyed this jiu  jitsu kaizen video and want to see more  please leave a like and if you're new to  anime upload remember to subscribe and  ring the bell of course you can also  follow anime uproar at anime uproar on  twitter or instagram or you can follow  myself at excellionyt i want to give a  big thank you to all of our patrons over  on patreon who allow videos like this to  be possible especially the patron of  legend the one who's acknowledged by  lord twigo himself alpha sigma as well  our the one tier patrons the ones who  stand above all clans in grata patahepha  al-jatal hinokami and water the toasted  chi the spike eight two two seven corey  mcgowan dylan isadore spidey life tinel  tungsten tarkus baked buddhist cody  hebert and monkey d quilly finally our  pro hero tier patrons gilgamesh the  red-haired raven annel cruz rathwind de  ora very gucci alicia ochter bonnie  parks joanne garcia ted noted fat boy  games and soulrise slice and dice if you  enjoy our work or maybe think we just  offer a little bit of extra enjoyment in  your day-to-day life please consider  going to patreon.com anime uproar and  supporting the channel for as little as  one dollar you will get your name  featured in future videos as well as  have access to our exclusive patron only  discord you can also join the youtube  channel by clicking that blue join  button next to the subscribe option but  whichever way you support us you will  get these same great benefits thank you  guys so much